WEBVTT

00:00.927 --> 00:04.727
[lively accordion music]
[活泼的手风琴音乐]

00:04.727 --> 00:10.661
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:13.027 --> 00:15.761
And how is everything
for you today, sir?
一切怎么样
先生，今天为您服务吗？

00:15.761 --> 00:17.461
Oh, it's great, just great.
噢，太棒了，太棒了。

00:17.461 --> 00:18.861
Fine, fine.
很好，很好。

00:18.861 --> 00:21.061
I just love this Krabby Patty.
我就是喜欢这个蟹肉饼。

00:21.061 --> 00:23.394
Okay, always nice to hear.
好吧，总是很高兴听到。

00:23.394 --> 00:25.161
My Krabby Patty
is a Krabby Patty,
我的蟹肉饼
是蟹肉饼，

00:25.161 --> 00:28.127
and both buns
are also Krabby Patties.
和两个面包
还有蟹黄饼。

00:28.127 --> 00:30.327
So luxurious!
好豪华啊！

00:30.327 --> 00:32.027
You must have paid
five times the price
你一定已经付款了
五倍价格

00:32.027 --> 00:34.427
of a regular patty for that.
一个普通的肉饼。

00:34.427 --> 00:37.227
No extra! It's the same low
price as a regular Krabby Patty.
没有额外的！都是一样的低
价格与普通蟹肉饼一样。

00:37.227 --> 00:38.494
[cash register rings]
[收银机铃声]

00:42.661 --> 00:46.427
Aah! Me eyes. What are you
doing, Mr. Squidward?
啊啊！我的眼睛。你是什么
章鱼哥先生，你在做什么？

00:46.427 --> 00:47.661
Aah!
啊啊！

00:47.661 --> 00:48.961
I couldn't find
the smelling salts,
我找不到
嗅盐，

00:48.961 --> 00:51.027
so I just used table salt.
所以我只用食盐。

00:51.027 --> 00:53.294
Hey, my Krabby Patty
is just a bun,
嘿，我的蟹黄派
只是一个馒头，

00:53.294 --> 00:57.094
and the two buns are also buns.
两个包子也是包子。

00:57.094 --> 00:58.227
Stale buns.
不新鲜的馒头。

00:58.227 --> 01:00.394
My patty tastes like sadness.
我的肉饼尝起来像悲伤。

01:00.394 --> 01:02.194
(Mr. Krabs)
All right, that's enough.
（蟹老板）
好吧，够了。

01:02.194 --> 01:05.294
Patties with emotional
flavors...[grunts]
带有情感的馅饼
味道...[咕哝]

01:05.294 --> 01:07.194
is two bits extra.
是额外的两位。

01:07.194 --> 01:09.827
Now pay at the register.
现在到收银台付款。

01:09.827 --> 01:13.661
What in Davy Jones' locker is
going on in here, Mr. Squidward?
戴维·琼斯的储物柜里有什么
这里发生什么事了，章鱼哥先生？

01:13.661 --> 01:17.127
What do you think?
SpongeBob's in one of his moods.
你怎么认为？
海绵宝宝正处于一种心情之中。

01:17.127 --> 01:19.694
He failed
his boating exam again.
他失败了
他再次参加划船考试。

01:19.694 --> 01:22.794
Well, we can't have that.
He's me best employee.
好吧，我们不能这样。
他是我最好的员工。

01:22.794 --> 01:24.961
- Well, no offense.
- None taken.
- 好吧，无意冒犯。
- 没有被采取。

01:24.961 --> 01:28.127
Melancholy and self-doubt
are bad for business.
忧郁和自我怀疑
对生意不利。

01:28.127 --> 01:29.461
Make a note of it.
记下它。

01:29.461 --> 01:31.061
Let me grab a pencil.
让我抓起一支铅笔。

01:31.061 --> 01:36.061
Ha, it's funny
'cause I mean the opposite. Ha.
哈，很有趣
因为我的意思恰恰相反。哈。

01:36.061 --> 01:39.794
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:40.927 --> 01:42.461
Avast there, lad.
阿瓦斯特在那里，小伙子。

01:42.461 --> 01:44.094
You're wasting
your valuable tears
你在浪费
你宝贵的眼泪

01:44.094 --> 01:46.194
salting me patties with grief.
悲伤地给我的肉饼加盐。

01:46.194 --> 01:47.861
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

01:47.861 --> 01:50.994
Oh, I can't even cry right.
唉，我连哭都哭不出来。

01:50.994 --> 01:52.494
(Mr. Krabs)
There, there.
（蟹老板）
那里，那里。

01:52.494 --> 01:54.761
Failing your driver's test
is nothing to cry over.
您的驾驶员考试未通过
没什么可哭的。

01:54.761 --> 01:58.661
Aw, I've been in driving school
as long as I can remember,
哦，我上过驾校
从我记事起

01:58.661 --> 02:01.027
and I still don't have
my license.
我还没有
我的执照。

02:01.027 --> 02:03.894
How much do they charge you
at this driving school of yours?
他们向你收取多少费用
在你们这个驾校吗？

02:03.894 --> 02:05.761
Oh, about $100 a semester.
哦，一个学期大约100美元。

02:05.761 --> 02:07.327
$100 a semester?
一学期100美元？

02:07.327 --> 02:09.827
Why, I could do it for double
the price in half the time!
为什么，我可以花双倍的钱
价格减半！

02:09.827 --> 02:11.094
Really?
真的吗？

02:11.094 --> 02:12.327
Sure!
I taught me own daughter Pearl
当然！
我教我自己的女儿珍珠

02:12.327 --> 02:15.661
how to drive
like a little angel.
如何驾驶
像一个小天使。

02:15.661 --> 02:18.494
Hi, Daddy.
I need money for shoes.
嗨，爸爸。
我需要钱买鞋。

02:18.494 --> 02:23.227
Sure! Anything for
me little angel, Pearl.
当然！一切为了
我的小天使，珍珠。

02:23.227 --> 02:28.094
Thanks, Daddy.
谢谢，爸爸。

02:28.094 --> 02:29.827
Are you sure about this,
Mr. Krabs?
你确定吗，
蟹老板？

02:29.827 --> 02:31.161
[laughs]
[笑]

02:31.161 --> 02:33.127
Why, I couldn't be surer, lad.
为什么，我不能更确定，小伙子。

02:33.127 --> 02:37.494
You don't need a "professional"
to teach you how to drive.
你不需要“专业人士”
教你如何开车。

02:37.494 --> 02:39.661
You know, Mr. Krabs,
at boating school, Mrs. Pu--
你知道，蟹老板先生，
在划船学校，浦老师——

02:39.661 --> 02:42.261
Wipe that boating school
malarkey out of your mind, son.
消灭那个划船学校
儿子，你脑子里胡言乱语。

02:42.261 --> 02:44.194
It's all a racket.
这都是骗局。

02:44.194 --> 02:45.661
[gasps] It is?
[喘气] 是吗？

02:45.661 --> 02:47.294
And that goes
for every kind of schoolin'.
就这样
适用于各种学校。

02:47.294 --> 02:49.527
Why, there ain't nothing
truly important
为什么，什么都没有
真正重要

02:49.527 --> 02:51.161
you can't learn on the streets
你无法在街上学习

02:51.161 --> 02:55.494
with half a jigger of common
sense and your own two claws.
与半跳常见的
感觉和你自己的两只爪子。

02:55.494 --> 02:57.661
Now put her in gear.
现在让她挂档。

02:57.661 --> 02:58.694
Okay.
好的。

02:58.694 --> 03:02.427
[engine starts]
[发动机启动]

03:03.894 --> 03:06.194
[groans]
[laughs]
[呻吟]
[笑]

03:06.194 --> 03:08.827
Well, rookie mistake, boy.
好吧，菜鸟错误，孩子。

03:08.827 --> 03:10.494
Happens all the time.
一直在发生。

03:10.494 --> 03:12.294
- It does?
- No.
- 是吗？
- 不。

03:12.294 --> 03:14.661
But you got the right fire
in your belly.
但你用对了火
在你的肚子里。

03:14.661 --> 03:16.227
I do?
我愿意？

03:16.227 --> 03:17.461
Yeah, well, you know,
是的，嗯，你知道，

03:17.461 --> 03:21.894
what we need
is a change of venue.
我们需要什么
就是换个地点。

03:21.894 --> 03:24.661
This empty parking lot
is just the ticket.
这个空荡荡的停车场
只是门票。

03:24.661 --> 03:26.561
Like every young person,
the novice boater
和每一个年轻人一样，
新手划船者

03:26.561 --> 03:29.727
needs plenty of open,
obstacle-free space
需要足够的开放空间，
无障碍空间

03:29.727 --> 03:32.294
and the freedom
to make mistakes.
和自由
犯错误。

03:32.294 --> 03:34.327
Mr. Krabs, you're so wise.
蟹老板，你真聪明。

03:34.327 --> 03:37.261
[chuckles]
Can't disagree with you there.
[笑声]
不能不同意你的观点。

03:37.261 --> 03:40.894
All right, put her in gear.
好吧，让她上车。

03:40.894 --> 03:43.061
[crash]
[碰撞]

03:43.061 --> 03:44.461
Hmm.
唔。

03:44.461 --> 03:45.694
Rookie mistake, right?
菜鸟错误，对吗？

03:45.694 --> 03:47.294
I suppose so.
我想是的。

03:47.294 --> 03:52.161
Now slowly inch forward and
we'll check out the damage.
现在慢慢地向前一寸
我们将检查损坏情况。

03:52.161 --> 03:55.127
Inch. Inch. Inch inch inch.
英寸。英寸。英寸英寸英寸。

03:55.127 --> 03:58.394
Inch, inch.
英寸，英寸。

04:01.327 --> 04:06.727
(Mr. Krabs)
Oh, broken wall.
That's about 15,000.
（蟹老板）
噢，破墙。
大约是 15,000。

04:06.727 --> 04:10.427
Oh, kitchen fire, oh.
That'll be about six grand.
哦，厨房着火了，哦。
那大约是六大。

04:10.427 --> 04:12.694
Ooh, lawsuit?
哦，诉讼？

04:12.694 --> 04:16.127
Ooh, that's a lot of zeroes.
噢，有很多零。

04:16.127 --> 04:18.827
Ugh.
啊。

04:18.827 --> 04:21.027
(Mr. Krabs voice-over)
All right, Krabs.
Get a hold of yourself.
（蟹先生画外音）
好吧，蟹蟹们。
控制住自己。

04:21.027 --> 04:23.261
You've been in worse fixes
than this.
你经历过更糟糕的修复
比这个。

04:23.261 --> 04:26.494
Why, you've stared down
the cannon's mouth, haven't ya?
为什么，你低头凝视
大炮的嘴，不是吗？

04:26.494 --> 04:29.727
Look at that face.
看看那张脸。

04:29.727 --> 04:31.394
Ew.
呃。

04:31.394 --> 04:34.461
(Mr. Krabs voice-over)
Is this the face
of your final defeat?
（蟹先生画外音）
这是脸吗
你最后的失败？

04:34.461 --> 04:35.994
Is it, Krabs?
是吗，蟹蟹？

04:35.994 --> 04:39.327
[heavy breathing]
[粗重的呼吸]

04:41.161 --> 04:44.494
Now, here's a place
you should be comfortable with.
现在，这里有一个地方
你应该感到舒服。

04:44.494 --> 04:45.827
Oh, I'll say.
哦，我会说。

04:45.827 --> 04:48.961
Just take a look around, boy-o.
Home sweet home.
看看周围吧，男孩。
家，甜蜜的家。

04:48.961 --> 04:52.461
Nothin' to make you
twitchy and jumpy.
没什么能让你
抽搐和神经质。

04:52.461 --> 04:54.094
Just the opposite, in fact.
事实上恰恰相反。

04:54.094 --> 04:57.194
A place so soothing and sweet,
一个如此舒缓和甜蜜的地方，

04:57.194 --> 05:02.094
like a mother's gentle lullaby
on a soft summer's night.
就像母亲温柔的摇篮曲
在一个柔和的夏夜。

05:02.094 --> 05:06.827
[SpongeBob snoring]
[海绵宝宝打呼噜]

05:06.827 --> 05:09.061
[horn honks]
[engine starts]
[喇叭鸣响]
[发动机启动]

05:09.061 --> 05:10.394
Oh, brother.
哦，兄弟。

05:10.394 --> 05:12.194
Let's start
with something simple.
让我们开始吧
用一些简单的东西。

05:12.194 --> 05:15.694
A little trip down the street
to Patrick's house.
沿着街道走一小段路
去帕特里克家。

05:15.694 --> 05:17.794
- Patrick's house!
- Whoa!
- 帕特里克的房子！
- 哇！

05:20.961 --> 05:22.961
I'll have one Krabby Patty,
please.
我要一份蟹肉饼
请。

05:22.961 --> 05:25.694
- Okay.
- Upsell.
- 好的。
- 追加销售。

05:25.694 --> 05:27.261
Ugh. Would you like fries
with that?
啊。你想吃薯条吗
与那个？

05:27.261 --> 05:31.361
- Yeah. Sounds good.
- Better.
- 是的。听起来不错。
- 更好的。

05:31.361 --> 05:34.061
Okay. That was just fine.
好的。那就好了。

05:34.061 --> 05:36.461
But next time, wait until I say,
但下次，等我说，

05:36.461 --> 05:39.327
"Put her into gear."
“让她挂上装备。”

05:39.327 --> 05:40.727
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

05:40.727 --> 05:43.227
[crash]
[碰撞]

05:43.227 --> 05:47.494
You missed one.
你错过了一个。

05:47.494 --> 05:51.194
A simple trip
to Patrick's house.
一次简单的旅行
去帕特里克家。

05:51.194 --> 05:55.727
A line so straight and true.
一条线如此笔直而真实。

05:55.727 --> 05:57.794
Mr. Krabs, let's just
leave the boat here and walk.
蟹老板，我们就这样吧
把船停在这里然后步行。

05:57.794 --> 05:59.761
Well, you know,
we could do that.
嗯，你知道，
我们可以做到。

05:59.761 --> 06:02.961
But you can't learn
to drive without a boat.
但你学不到
没有船就开车。

06:02.961 --> 06:05.494
Or can ye?
或者你可以吗？

06:05.494 --> 06:07.794
You'll certainly learn the way
of the road with this here
你一定会学到方法
这条路在这里

06:07.794 --> 06:11.094
top of the line, state of the
art technological simulator.
行的顶部，状态
艺术技术模拟器。

06:11.094 --> 06:13.494
[game beeping]
[游戏提示音]

06:13.494 --> 06:16.727
Now hand me one of them tokens.
现在递给我其中一枚代币。

06:16.727 --> 06:18.727
You'll need
your protective head gear.
你需要
你的头部防护装备。

06:18.727 --> 06:21.094
(computer)
Ready? Drive.
（电脑）
准备好了吗？驾驶。

06:22.794 --> 06:27.061
I'm doing it, Mr. Krabs.
I'm driving the boat!
我正在做，蟹老板。
我正在驾驶船！

06:27.061 --> 06:28.027
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

06:28.027 --> 06:30.661
[squealing tires]
[crash]
[轮胎吱吱作响]
[崩溃]

06:30.661 --> 06:33.661
(computer)
Sixth place.
（电脑）
第六名。

06:42.827 --> 06:44.661
Hey, look, Mr. Krabs.
I'm actually driving.
嘿，看，蟹老板。
我其实是在开车。

06:44.661 --> 06:45.894
Great job, boy.
干得好，孩子。

06:45.894 --> 06:47.494
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

06:52.561 --> 06:54.527
[hammering]
[锤击]

06:58.061 --> 06:59.694
Phew.
唷。

07:07.161 --> 07:09.461
Hmm.
[gasp]
唔。
[喘气]

07:09.461 --> 07:13.661
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:18.127 --> 07:20.894
Well, at least I didn't hit
the Krusty Krab that time.
还好，至少我没撞到
那时的蟹堡王。

07:20.894 --> 07:23.127
[laughs]
[笑]

07:33.694 --> 07:35.927
[cash register chimes]
[收银机铃声]

07:40.327 --> 07:43.394
Saw that comin'.
看到了。

07:43.394 --> 07:45.161
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

07:45.161 --> 07:48.694
The fire in my belly
has gone pssssh.
我肚子里的火
已经走了。

07:48.694 --> 07:50.994
No, no, it's my fault.
不，不，这是我的错。

07:50.994 --> 07:53.561
We've been going about this
all wrong, boy.
我们一直在讨论这个
都错了，孩子。

07:53.561 --> 07:55.961
It's not a pampering
you be needing,
这不是一种纵容
你需要，

07:55.961 --> 07:59.227
it's a bold and reckless display
of confidence.
这是一种大胆而鲁莽的展示
的信心。

07:59.227 --> 08:00.661
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

08:00.661 --> 08:02.661
You think when I was your age
I tiptoed around
你以为我在你这个年纪的时候
我踮着脚尖四处走动

08:02.661 --> 08:05.394
like a tadpole on a petunia?
就像矮牵牛上的蝌蚪？

08:05.394 --> 08:07.194
- You never!
- That's right.
- 你从来没有！
- 这是正确的。

08:07.194 --> 08:11.527
My style was to dive in
with both feet, claws snapping.
我的风格是潜入
双脚，爪子折断。

08:11.527 --> 08:14.561
Snapping!
啪！

08:14.561 --> 08:16.361
(SpongeBob)
Oh, my gosh.
（海绵宝宝）
哦，天哪。

08:16.361 --> 08:18.261
(Mr. Krabs)
Thar she blows.
（蟹老板）
她吹。

08:18.261 --> 08:20.394
The dreaded double roundabout,
可怕的双环岛，

08:20.394 --> 08:24.261
the most treacherous stretch
of road in all of Bikini Bottom.
最危险的一段
整个比基尼底部的道路。

08:24.261 --> 08:25.594
To your starboard, you yield.
向你的右舷屈服。

08:25.594 --> 08:28.327
To your port they yield to you.
到了你的港口，他们就会屈服于你。

08:28.327 --> 08:31.494
And when you're in the middle,
it's every man for himself
当你在中间时，
每个人都是为了自己

08:31.494 --> 08:33.194
and the devil take the rest.
剩下的就交给魔鬼吧。

08:33.194 --> 08:35.261
I don't think I'm ready
for this, Mr. Krabs.
我认为我还没有准备好
为此，蟹老板。

08:35.261 --> 08:36.827
Nonsense, boy-o.
废话，小伙子。

08:36.827 --> 08:39.527
All it takes is some confidence
and a little coordination.
所需要的只是一些信心
和一点协调。

08:39.527 --> 08:43.527
Why, your little pet snail
could do it.
为什么，你的小宠物蜗牛
可以做到。

08:43.527 --> 08:44.927
[meows]
[喵喵]

08:44.927 --> 08:46.127
Uh, I thought you
were just using Gary
呃，我以为你
我们只是用加里

08:46.127 --> 08:47.994
as a colorful example,
Mr. Krabs.
作为一个丰富多彩的例子，
蟹老板。

08:47.994 --> 08:49.827
Oh, he's colorful, all right.
哦，他是色彩缤纷的，好吧。

08:49.827 --> 08:53.561
But he's also going to teach you
how to drive. Now go.
但他也会教你
如何驾驶。现在走吧。

08:53.561 --> 08:55.327
[meows]
[喵喵]

08:55.327 --> 08:56.961
(SpongeBob)
Whoa!
（海绵宝宝）
哇！

08:56.961 --> 08:58.661
Atta boy.
阿塔男孩。

09:06.094 --> 09:08.227
There you go, SpongeBob.
给你，海绵宝宝。

09:08.227 --> 09:10.661
Did you see how Gary did that?
你看到加里是怎么做的吗？

09:10.661 --> 09:12.761
Uh, yeah. Some of it.
呃，是的。其中一些。

09:12.761 --> 09:16.161
Buck up, me boy-o.
It's your turn next.
振作起来，我的孩子。
接下来轮到你了。

09:16.161 --> 09:19.461
My turn? Gee, Mr. Krabs,
you must really believe in me.
轮到我了吗？哎呀，蟹老板先生，
你一定真的相信我。

09:19.461 --> 09:20.461
Not really.
并不真地。

09:20.461 --> 09:22.394
[police siren wails]
[警笛鸣响]

09:22.394 --> 09:24.361
Sir, is this your vehicle?
先生，这是您的车吗？

09:24.361 --> 09:26.194
Why, yes, yes, officer. It is.
为什么，是的，是的，警官。这是。

09:26.194 --> 09:28.061
And did I just see you
let a snail negotiate
我刚刚看到你吗
让蜗牛谈判

09:28.061 --> 09:30.327
this vehicle through
a dangerous intersection?
这辆车通过
危险的十字路口？

09:30.327 --> 09:33.527
You sure did--Ah, I mean
you didn't--I mean, well, no.
你确实做到了——啊，我是说
你没有——我的意思是，好吧，没有。

09:33.527 --> 09:35.027
Well, uh, yes, I mean...
嗯，呃，是的，我的意思是...

09:35.027 --> 09:37.061
Look, it was just
a friendly little example.
瞧，这只是
一个友好的小例子。

09:37.061 --> 09:40.027
A colorful example.
I was teaching the lad to drive.
一个丰富多彩的例子。
我正在教那个小伙子开车。

09:40.027 --> 09:41.961
By putting a snail
behind the wheel.
通过放一只蜗牛
方向盘后面。

09:41.961 --> 09:45.461
Well, I mean, really,
he was more on top of the wheel.
嗯，我的意思是，真的，
他更加掌控方向盘。

09:45.461 --> 09:47.094
[meows]
[喵喵]

09:47.094 --> 09:48.661
Officer, I don't have the
boating handbook with me, but--
警官，我没有
随身携带划船手册，但是——

09:48.661 --> 09:50.161
Quiet, boy. Let me handle this.
安静，男孩。让我来处理这件事。

09:50.161 --> 09:52.927
Are you a licensed
driving instructor, sir?
您是否已获得许可
驾驶教练，先生？

09:52.927 --> 09:56.894
Well, no, but I taught
me own little girl to drive,
嗯，不，但我教过
我自己的小女儿开车，

09:56.894 --> 09:59.461
you see, and--and
you understand.
你看，还有——还有
你明白。

09:59.461 --> 10:02.661
Do you have any kiddies
of your own at home, officer?
你有小朋友吗
警官，你自己在家吗？

10:02.661 --> 10:04.427
No, I'm married to my job.
不，我已经和我的工作结婚了。

10:04.427 --> 10:05.794
Oh.
哦。

10:05.794 --> 10:10.161
Well, um, you two seem
very happy together.
嗯，嗯，你们两个看起来
在一起很开心。

10:10.161 --> 10:11.861
Well, we've had
our ups and downs,
嗯，我们已经有过
我们的起起落落，

10:11.861 --> 10:13.727
but after
some couples counseling
但之后
一些夫妻咨询

10:13.727 --> 10:17.927
we think we've
worked out our issues.
我们认为我们已经
解决了我们的问题。

10:17.927 --> 10:21.661
This ticket's coming
out of your paycheck, boy.
这张票来了
孩子，你的薪水已经用光了。

10:21.661 --> 10:24.694
Whoa. My first
real traffic ticket.
哇哦。我的第一个
真正的交通罚单。

10:24.694 --> 10:28.127
Oh, this is going to require
something more than money, sir.
哦，这需要
比金钱更重要的东西，先生。

10:28.127 --> 10:32.261
What could be worse
than spending money?
还有什么可能更糟
比花钱？

10:32.261 --> 10:33.394
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:33.394 --> 10:34.961
All right, class.
好吧，上课。

10:34.961 --> 10:38.661
Please say hello to our newest
classmate, Mr. Krabs.
请向我们最新的
同学，蟹老板。

10:38.661 --> 10:42.861
(all)
Hello, Mr. Krabs.
（全部）
你好，蟹老板。

10:42.861 --> 10:45.661
Don't worry, Mr. K.
I'll show you the ropes.
别担心，K先生。
我会告诉你诀窍。

10:49.027 --> 10:52.227
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

10:52.227 --> 10:58.161
*
*
*
*

*